{
  "id": "ebb:demo/counter_ledger_dialogue",
  "start": "start",
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "柜台账本摊开着，像一本假装只记录酒钱的证词目录。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "read",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "查看最近的房费记录。",
          "next": "read_line",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_story_var",
              "layer": "minor",
              "id": "ledger_seen",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mark",
          "type": "action",
          "text": "把缺失的一行折角标出来。",
          "next": "mark_line",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "set_scene_phase",
              "scene": "ebb:demo/locked_room",
              "phase": "paper_trail"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "think",
          "type": "thought",
          "text": "账本不是记忆；它是被允许留下来的记忆。",
          "next": "think_line"
        }
      ]
    },
    "read_line": {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "最近一笔房费没有房号，只有一个被水渍拖长的首字母。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "回到观察。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    },
    "mark_line": {
      "speaker": "inner voice",
      "text": "你没有偷走证据，只是让它以后更难假装自己没被看见。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "回到观察。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    },
    "think_line": {
      "speaker": "inner voice",
      "text": "纸张的沉默比人的沉默便宜，但更耐久。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "back",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "回到观察。",
          "next": "start"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
